{"title": "Cities Receive Rain, Offering Relief from Heat and Humidity", "summary": "Several Indian cities experienced rain and thunderstorms, providing relief from rising heat and humidity. Kanpur received showers and thunderstorms, alleviating the heat. Jaipur and Sikar, facing high humidity and heat, were issued yellow alerts for rain, anticipating a respite. The weather changes brought a temporary end to the prevailing hot conditions in these regions.", "summary_points": ["Kanpur received rain and thunderstorms.", "The rainfall in Kanpur brought relief from the heat.", "Jaipur experienced rising humidity and heat.", "A yellow alert for rain was issued in Sikar.", "The weather changes offered relief from hot conditions."], "title_hi": "शहरों में बारिश, गर्मी और उमस से मिली राहत", "summary_hi": "कई भारतीय शहरों में बारिश और गरज के साथ बौछारें पड़ीं, जिससे बढ़ती गर्मी और उमस से राहत मिली। कानपुर में बारिश और गरज के साथ बौछारें पड़ीं, जिससे गर्मी से राहत मिली। जयपुर और सीकर, जहां उमस और गर्मी बढ़ रही थी, वहां बारिश के लिए येलो अलर्ट जारी किया गया, जिससे राहत की उम्मीद जगी। इन क्षेत्रों में मौसम परिवर्तन से मौजूदा गर्म परिस्थितियों का अस्थायी रूप से अंत हुआ।", "summary_points_hi": ["कानपुर में बारिश और गरज के साथ बौछारें पड़ीं।", "कानपुर की बारिश से गर्मी से राहत मिली।", "जयपुर में उमस और गर्मी बढ़ रही थी।", "सीकर में बारिश के लिए येलो अलर्ट जारी किया गया।", "मौसम परिवर्तन से गर्म परिस्थितियों से राहत मिली।"], "framing": {"center": ["Centrist coverage focused on the weather events themselves, reporting the specific rainfall and thunderstorm occurrences in cities like Kanpur. The reports highlighted the relief these showers provided from the prevailing heat and humidity, also noting weather alerts issued for other regions like Jaipur and Sikar."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["केंद्र-उन्मुख कवरेज कानपुर जैसे शहरों में विशिष्ट वर्षा और गरज के साथ बौछार की घटनाओं की रिपोर्टिंग करते हुए, स्वयं मौसम की घटनाओं पर केंद्रित था। रिपोर्टों में जयपुर और सीकर जैसे अन्य क्षेत्रों के लिए जारी किए गए मौसम अलर्ट को भी ध्यान में रखते हुए, मौजूदा गर्मी और उमस से इन बौछारों द्वारा प्रदान की गई राहत पर प्रकाश डाला गया।"]}, "topic": "Environment", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://static.toiimg.com/thumb/msid-132811697,width-1280,height-720,resizemode-6,overlay-toi_sw,pt-32,y_pad-600/photo.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "Dainik Bhaskar", "owner": "DB Corp", "lean": "center", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.bhaskar.com/local/rajasthan/jaipur/news/jaipur-weather-update-monsoon-humidity-heat-rain-forecast-138609590.html", "headline": "Jaipur Weather Update | Humidity And Heat Rise As Rain Stays Away"}, {"source": "Dainik Bhaskar", "owner": "DB Corp", "lean": "center", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.bhaskar.com/local/rajasthan/sikar/news/sikar-weather-update-yellow-alert-monsoon-rain-forecast-138610058.html", "headline": "Sikar Weather Update | Yellow Alert For Rain Relief From Humidity"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/kanpur/kanpur-receives-rain-thunderstorms-bringing-relief-from-heat/articleshow/132811698.cms", "headline": "Kanpur receives rain & thunderstorms , bringing relief from heat"}, {"source": "Dainik Bhaskar", "owner": "DB Corp", "lean": "center", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.bhaskar.com/local/uttar-pradesh/meerut/news/meerut-weather-update-rain-humidity-forecast-sawan-2026-138617752.html", "headline": "Meerut Weather Update | Clouds Humidity Rain Forecast Sawan 2026"}, {"source": "Dainik Bhaskar", "owner": "DB Corp", "lean": "center", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.bhaskar.com/local/rajasthan/tonk/news/tonk-weather-update-heavy-rain-forecast-monsoon-news-138618371.html", "headline": "Tonk Weather Update | Heavy Rain Forecast & Pleasant Monsoon Climate"}, {"source": "Dainik Bhaskar", "owner": "DB Corp", "lean": "center", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.bhaskar.com/local/ra